Upstream: https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/127301

Extended downstream: the hmac.py hunks close the same FIPS gap for the
builtin HACL* HMAC that CPython 3.14 added after the upstream PR was
written. See Lib/test/_test_hashlib_fips.py for the regression tests.

